From 4a16e1f1c1a6af42351c08c3c30e6b03a584c7c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: noname713705 <noname713705@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:38:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Build REL-0.8 with gradle-0.6 from build files in the 0.6 DSL

The 0.8 build files are unchanged. Added, for the gradle-0.6 builder:
- settings.gradle.0.6: the projects of settings.gradle with the <name>.gradle.0.6 build files;
  buildSrc/settings.gradle.0.6 selects buildSrc/build.gradle.0.6
- build.gradle.0.6, subprojects/*/<name>.gradle.0.6, buildSrc/build.gradle.0.6: copies of the 0.8
  files translated to 0.6 (classesDir, compile tasks, build.taskGraph, classpaths on the compile
  tasks, configuration build dependencies); code-quality, ide, test fixtures, integration tests,
  docs, zips and release left out; subprojects share the root version; project jars taken from
  the jar tasks; version properties at org/gradle/version.properties
- svnkit 1.3.5 (org.tmatesoft.svnkit), com.jcraft:jsch: on Maven Central
Source: MAVEN_CENTRAL_URL https, without trailing slash.

Run: gradle-0.6 -c settings.gradle.0.6 -Dskip.test=true -Dskip.testCompile=true -Dskip.javadoc=true
  -Dskip.groovydoc=true clean explodedDistBase

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
